       "heading": "Why it's worth doing properly",
       "body": "A POA that is vague, mistranslated or missing a power gets rejected at the counter — and you lose the transaction window.",
       "points": "Written by qualified lawyers, never generated from a generic template\nPrecise wording for your exact powers, scope and parties, so it's accepted first time\nBilingual Arabic and English, exactly as UAE notaries and authorities require\nNotarisation arranged and attended online — no queues, no appointments in person\nAttestation and certified translation can be added to the same mandate when the POA is used abroad"
