       "heading": "The five phases",
       "body": "Each phase feeds the next, so the order matters. We keep the file moving between DHA, MOFA, your consulate and GDRFA/ICP without you visiting an office.",
       "points": "Pre-documentation — both parents' passports and Emirates IDs plus an attested marriage certificate\nBirth certificate — hospital birth notification, DHA upload, online payment and courier delivery\nMOFA attestation — door-to-door collection of the original certificate and return once attested\nPassport — appointment and application at your home-country embassy or consulate\nVisa issuance — Emirates ID application, visa stamping, approval and card delivery"
